Hi,

today I got place and date of the next Ubuntu Developer Summit (UDS):

http://uds.ubuntu.com/

It will take place on 7th-11th May 2012 in the Oakland Marriott City 
Center, Oakland, California.

With the OpenPrinting Summit taking place on April 23-27, having one 
week between the OP Summit and the UDS I would either have long-distance 
flights and 9-hour time switches on 4 subsequent weekends or staying a 
whole extra week in the bay area, staying away from home for three 
subsequent weeks.

Therefore I suggest to move the OpenPrinting Summit and PWG meeting to 
one week later, April 30 to May 4 (is May 1 a holiday in California or 
not?).

Or what is the best suggestion here?

    Till
